.firebase

# Service account keys. One of these is a credential to the whole Firebase
# project — read/write on everybody's data, rules included — and it lands in
# this directory by default when you download one. It belongs in the
# FIREBASE_SERVICE_ACCOUNT GitHub secret and nowhere else; see
# FIREBASE_SETUP.md. Ignored by pattern rather than by name so the next one
# is covered too.
*firebase-adminsdk*.json
service-account*.json
serviceAccount*.json
